(7761545, 1285902, 67145, '<td valign="top">awwww .. so sweet and i''m loving the light shining through her beard .. <br/>i''m thinking this might be one of Mary''s lovely dogs .. Rhiannon, Paddy or Bean .. i''m sorry i cant tell them apart .. but they all look so gentle and wise  .. :)</td>', 'awwww .. so sweet and i''m loving the light shining through her beard .. i''m thinking this might be one of Mary''s lovely dogs .. Rhiannon, Paddy or Bean .. i''m sorry i cant tell them apart .. but they all look so gentle and wise  .. :)', '2024-01-01 02:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
