(7761818, 1285834, 56502, '<td valign="top">Looks weird - what is it??</td>', 'Looks weird - what is it??', '2024-01-07 13:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761827, 1285810, 38032, '<td valign="top">Well shot, treated, and composed image of someone with an exceptional look. 8</td>', 'Well shot, treated, and composed image of someone with an exceptional look. 8', '2024-01-07 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761828, 1285845, 38032, '<td valign="top">Well shot. 7</td>', 'Well shot. 7', '2024-01-07 15:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761829, 1285919, 103142, '<td valign="top">This was a 9 from me because of the lighting. The lighting is really well done. I dont even have any suggestions. Id be curious what the whole bike would look like, but then I think youd lose the great details on the handlebar tape. Beautifully done!</td>', 'This was a 9 from me because of the lighting. The lighting is really well done. I dont even have any suggestions. Id be curious what the whole bike would look like, but then I think youd lose the great details on the handlebar tape. Beautifully done!', '2024-01-07 16:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761830, 1285901, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love the softness and editing on this. Really really beautiful. 9 from me. The only thing Id think about changing is the crop. It seems like more space on the left would be good. Since the lily and the bottle thats laying down point to the left, it feels like it could use a little more breathing room. Plus the extra space at the top seems to need some balancing. Really beautiful. -9-</td>', 'Love the softness and editing on this. Really really beautiful. 9 from me. The only thing Id think about changing is the crop. It seems like more space on the left would be good. Since the lily and the bottle thats laying down point to the left, it feels like it could use a little more breathing room. Plus the extra space at the top seems to need some balancing. Really beautiful. -9-', '2024-01-07 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761831, 1285912, 103142, '<td valign="top">I didnt even notice it was a piano when I voted. Obviously people will think the cat shouldnt be behind the scroll. The setup isnt perfect, but it was an intriguing story. I gave it a 9 for the find and the story. Now that I see its a piano, it seems like maybe some more space at the top? It seems a little crowded up there. -9-</td>', 'I didnt even notice it was a piano when I voted. Obviously people will think the cat shouldnt be behind the scroll. The setup isnt perfect, but it was an intriguing story. I gave it a 9 for the find and the story. Now that I see its a piano, it seems like maybe some more space at the top? It seems a little crowded up there. -9-', '2024-01-07 16:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761832, 1285876, 103142, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot because of the droplets. So clean and beautiful. Dont really have any suggestions. At first I thought a portrait crop, but I like the oof leading lines of the leaves to the left. Then I thought, place him more to the right, not centered, but I like it this way. So cant think of anything to make it better. -9-</td>', 'Amazing shot because of the droplets. So clean and beautiful. Dont really have any suggestions. At first I thought a portrait crop, but I like the oof leading lines of the leaves to the left. Then I thought, place him more to the right, not centered, but I like it this way. So cant think of anything to make it better. -9-', '2024-01-07 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761833, 1285810, 103142, '<td valign="top">-9- from me. Cant think of anything to improve it. You captured a story thats intriguing and did it beautifully. -9-</td>', '-9- from me. Cant think of anything to improve it. You captured a story thats intriguing and did it beautifully. -9-', '2024-01-07 16:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761836, 1285879, 103142, '<td valign="top">The textures and the eye are wonderful, but the crop is just too distracting, imo. Even if you cropped part of the nose off, I think it would look better than having it so tight.</td>', 'The textures and the eye are wonderful, but the crop is just too distracting, imo. Even if you cropped part of the nose off, I think it would look better than having it so tight.', '2024-01-07 21:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761837, 1285893, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the find, but it doesn''t work for me. The shadow takes up so much and is a little interesting, but doesn''t hold my interest for long. And lining the wall up on the edge but having it slightly tilted feels off. Perhaps a different crop or tilting it even more?</td>', 'I like the idea and the find, but it doesn''t work for me. The shadow takes up so much and is a little interesting, but doesn''t hold my interest for long. And lining the wall up on the edge but having it slightly tilted feels off. Perhaps a different crop or tilting it even more?', '2024-01-07 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761838, 1285448, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I think a bit of space around it would look better. The crop seems tight and strangely uneven. Not centered, but not that off center, either.</td>', 'Nicely done, but I think a bit of space around it would look better. The crop seems tight and strangely uneven. Not centered, but not that off center, either.', '2024-01-07 21:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761839, 1285909, 103142, '<td valign="top">It is very nice, but not very memorable. It looks like there''s a bench out on the spit of land? Perhaps working that into the composition might give it more of a story? -6-</td>', 'It is very nice, but not very memorable. It looks like there''s a bench out on the spit of land? Perhaps working that into the composition might give it more of a story? -6-', '2024-01-07 21:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761840, 1285891, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and it''s interesting how close the buildings are to the water. But because of the bright backlighting, there''s not much separation in the foreground elements. It gets a little muddy with the multiple boats and buildings. I think it would have been better to wait until the boats were gone (or clone out?) or to do some bracketing to be able to bring out the foreground elements a little more so they don''t blend into each other? -6-</td>', 'Nice sky and it''s interesting how close the buildings are to the water. But because of the bright backlighting, there''s not much separation in the foreground elements. It gets a little muddy with the multiple boats and buildings. I think it would have been better to wait until the boats were gone (or clone out?) or to do some bracketing to be able to bring out the foreground elements a little more so they don''t blend into each other? -6-', '2024-01-07 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761841, 1285783, 103142, '<td valign="top">The subject is so incredibly beautiful, but the rest of the photo really doesn''t seem to add to it at all. Perhaps if you would have brought more warmth into the background golds? Cropping differently -- adding a little more space underneath to show more of the brilliant gold reflections and show less of the less interesting top 1/3 of the photo. -6-</td>', 'The subject is so incredibly beautiful, but the rest of the photo really doesn''t seem to add to it at all. Perhaps if you would have brought more warmth into the background golds? Cropping differently -- adding a little more space underneath to show more of the brilliant gold reflections and show less of the less interesting top 1/3 of the photo. -6-', '2024-01-07 21:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761842, 1285834, 103142, '<td valign="top">It looks like a fascinating place, but the shadows are so deep and it''s dark so I can''t really explore it as much as I''d like. -6-</td>', 'It looks like a fascinating place, but the shadows are so deep and it''s dark so I can''t really explore it as much as I''d like. -6-', '2024-01-07 21:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761843, 1285917, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, though it seems a little heavily done. I wish there was a little more space for Moe to breathe. --6--</td>', 'Nice tones, though it seems a little heavily done. I wish there was a little more space for Moe to breathe. --6--', '2024-01-07 21:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761844, 1285844, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is really really nice -- but it seems so oversharpened, it''s making it uncomfortable to view on the screen. :(</td>', 'This is really really nice -- but it seems so oversharpened, it''s making it uncomfortable to view on the screen. :(', '2024-01-07 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761845, 1285902, 103142, '<td valign="top">It seems like the backlighting was so incredibly bright that you lost the dark tones in processing (or in having to overexpose when shooting. I think you needed a more filtered backlit sun so the lovely lady didn''t end up a greyish green on the face and by the ears. =6=</td>', 'It seems like the backlighting was so incredibly bright that you lost the dark tones in processing (or in having to overexpose when shooting. I think you needed a more filtered backlit sun so the lovely lady didn''t end up a greyish green on the face and by the ears. =6=', '2024-01-07 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761847, 1285876, 27608, '<td valign="top">Wow crazy photo and with the droplets!!!</td>', 'Wow crazy photo and with the droplets!!!', '2024-01-07 22:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7761848, 1285771, 27608, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting!</td>', 'Looks like a painting!', '2024-01-07 22:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
